OL,3,GNEWSATown residents demand action over
OL,4,A'eyesore' river
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 600 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition calling on authorities to deal
OL,8,Fwith an "eyesore" section of river in
OL,9,FMarket Harborough.
OL,11,FResidents have raised concerns over
OL,12,Fpotential flood risks due to overgrown
OL,13,Fvegetation along parts of the River
OL,14,FWelland, while others have commented on
OL,15,Fthe state of the river's appearance.
OL,17,FThe East Mercia Rivers Trust (EMRT) has
OL,18,Fembarked on a #36,000 council-funded
OL,19,Fproject to improve the river's flow in
OL,20,FWelland Park.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
